      <title>大唐杯仿真</title>
      <link href="/2026/04/18/%E5%A4%A7%E5%94%90%E6%9D%AF%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F/"/>
      <url>/2026/04/18/%E5%A4%A7%E5%94%90%E6%9D%AF%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="大唐杯仿真"><a href="#大唐杯仿真" class="headerlink" title="大唐杯仿真"></a>大唐杯仿真</h1><h2 id="电信业务（bilibili不想做仿真的熊二）（1）"><a href="#电信业务（bilibili不想做仿真的熊二）（1）" class="headerlink" title="电信业务（bilibili不想做仿真的熊二）（1）"></a>电信业务（bilibili不想做仿真的熊二）（1）</h2><h3 id="号码办理"><a href="#号码办理" class="headerlink" title="号码办理"></a>号码办理</h3><p><img src="https://img.luminesight.com/i/2026/04/23/69ea32352bb9a.png" alt="image-20260418155204999"></p><p>可以根据自己的手机号填，无所谓</p><p><img src="https://img.luminesight.com/i/2026/04/23/69ea323594cee.png" alt="image-20260418155258170"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418155312110.png" alt="image-20260418155312110"></p><p>要求是150min 2G选业务办理1 200分钟，业务办理2 4G流量5G</p><h3 id="基础业务办理"><a href="#基础业务办理" class="headerlink" title="基础业务办理"></a>基础业务办理</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418155554620.png" alt="image-20260418155554620"></p><p>选中手机号码无所谓</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418155730441.png" alt="image-20260418155730441"></p><p>选中第一个基站，空口控制面协议</p><h3 id="基础机房"><a href="#基础机房" class="headerlink" title="基础机房"></a>基础机房</h3><p>光纤通信基础：</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418155818890.png" alt="image-20260418155818890"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418155854627.png" alt="image-20260418155854627"></p><p>AAU压缩，BBU解压缩后再保存，否则线路变红</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418160233741.png" alt="image-20260418160233741"></p><p>要确保左边传出的信封要与上方信封一样（视频中是试出来的。。）</p><p>光纤通信线路模拟：</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418160349374.png" alt="image-20260418160349374"></p><p>以上为要求，单模为0.5db&#x2F;km,多模为3db&#x2F;km</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418160750326.png" alt="image-20260418160750326"></p><p>计算后为真好53db&#x2F;km，简单来说是凑数，一个简单数学题</p><p>通过后选中基础机房</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418160913327.png" alt="image-20260418160913327"></p><p>固定7°（记住答案。。）</p><h3 id="核心机房"><a href="#核心机房" class="headerlink" title="核心机房"></a>核心机房</h3><p>网络架构：</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418161056334.png" alt="image-20260418161056334"></p><p>考察中英互译（记住答案。。）</p><p>语音通信流程：</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418161629636.png" alt="image-20260418161629636"></p><h3 id="左下手机"><a href="#左下手机" class="headerlink" title="左下手机"></a>左下手机</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418161833304.png" alt="image-20260418161833304"></p><p>以上为左下角中间手机答案</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418161900411.png" alt="image-20260418161900411"></p><h3 id="增值业务办理"><a href="#增值业务办理" class="headerlink" title="增值业务办理"></a>增值业务办理</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162005925.png" alt="image-20260418162005925"></p><p>跟之前号码办理是一样的（随便选无所谓。。）</p><h3 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h3><p>大部分都是记忆点，没有啥技术含量 记住就好</p><h2 id="信号塔（2）"><a href="#信号塔（2）" class="headerlink" title="信号塔（2）"></a>信号塔（2）</h2><p>信号塔和基础机房纯硬背</p><h3 id="支撑杆"><a href="#支撑杆" class="headerlink" title="支撑杆"></a>支撑杆</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162527863.png" alt="image-20260418162527863"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162552973.png" alt="image-20260418162552973"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162608019.png" alt="image-20260418162608019"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162615480.png" alt="image-20260418162615480"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162626057.png" alt="image-20260418162626057"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162633990.png" alt="image-20260418162633990"></p><h3 id="仿生树"><a href="#仿生树" class="headerlink" title="仿生树"></a>仿生树<img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162711739.png" alt="image-20260418162711739"></h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162741386.png" alt="image-20260418162741386"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162753192.png" alt="image-20260418162753192"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162807049.png" alt="image-20260418162807049"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162816686.png" alt="image-20260418162816686"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162823091.png" alt="image-20260418162823091"></p><h3 id="顶楼美化天线"><a href="#顶楼美化天线" class="headerlink" title="顶楼美化天线"></a>顶楼美化天线</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162941278.png" alt="image-20260418162941278"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162924645.png" alt="image-20260418162924645"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418162955995.png" alt="image-20260418162955995"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163002243.png" alt="image-20260418163002243"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163017303.png" alt="image-20260418163017303"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-2026041816302495