ng\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163610128.png" alt="image-20260418163610128"></p><h3 id="2G-BTS"><a href="#2G-BTS" class="headerlink" title="2G-BTS"></a>2G-BTS</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163657415.png" alt="image-20260418163657415"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163713218.png" alt="image-20260418163713218"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163727633.png" alt="image-20260418163727633"></p><h3 id="3G-BBU"><a href="#3G-BBU" class="headerlink" title="3G-BBU"></a>3G-BBU</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163757798.png" alt="image-20260418163757798"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163807466.png" alt="image-20260418163807466"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163813901.png" alt="image-20260418163813901"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163827891.png" alt="image-20260418163827891"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418163833542.png" alt="image-20260418163833542"></p><p>4G-BBU</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164016928.png" alt="image-20260418164016928"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164032521.png" alt="image-20260418164032521"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164056321.png" alt="image-20260418164056321"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164110779.png" alt="image-20260418164110779"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164123671.png" alt="image-20260418164123671"></p><h3 id="DCPD配置界面"><a href="#DCPD配置界面" class="headerlink" title="DCPD配置界面"></a>DCPD配置界面</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164152059.png" alt="image-20260418164152059"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164158971.png" alt="image-20260418164158971"></p><h3 id="5G-BBU"><a href="#5G-BBU" class="headerlink" title="5G-BBU"></a>5G-BBU</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164230558.png" alt="image-20260418164230558"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164238679.png" alt="image-20260418164238679"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164247010.png" alt="image-20260418164247010"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164253881.png" alt="image-20260418164253881"></p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164300850.png" alt="image-20260418164300850"></p><h3 id="直流电源柜配置界面"><a href="#直流电源柜配置界面" class="headerlink" title="直流电源柜配置界面"></a>直流电源柜配置界面</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164332356.png" alt="image-20260418164332356"></p><h3 id="交流电源柜配置界面"><a href="#交流电源柜配置界面" class="headerlink" title="交流电源柜配置界面"></a>交流电源柜配置界面</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164352710.png" alt="image-20260418164352710"></p><h3 id="空调配置界面"><a href="#空调配置界面" class="headerlink" title="空调配置界面"></a>空调配置界面</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418164406967.png" alt="image-20260418164406967"></p><h2 id="传输-核心机房（2）"><a href="#传输-核心机房（2）" class="headerlink" title="传输&amp;核心机房（2）"></a>传输&amp;核心机房（2）</h2><p>要求：</p><p>传输网络是通信接入网络连接核心网的重要媒介，现要求根据机房的<br>实际情况完成如下任务。<br>1、点击进入延安机房，依次完成核心网机柜和传输机柜基本配置;<br>2、分别点击地图中6个机房，根据不同机房类型为传输柜添加正确传输设畬(包含2&amp;5G传输设备);<br>3、依次点击机房查看ODF架中光缆信息区信息展示，整理机房之间光缆布放信息;<br>4、根据光缆布放信息添加正确线路完成承载网接入层、汇聚层、核心层机房的连接，要求形成环网结构;(注意:接入机房需要同时完成PTN和SDH两套传输的配置)<br>5、根据ODF架不同区域接口的不同，选择正确的线缆进行传输设备跳纤。</p><h3 id="延安核心机房"><a href="#延安核心机房" class="headerlink" title="延安核心机房"></a>延安核心机房</h3><h4 id="5GC"><a href="#5GC" class="headerlink" title="5GC:"></a>5GC:</h4><p>EMBB（增强型移动带宽）应用场景包括: 4K&#x2F;8K直播&#x2F;点播、AR、VR、4K&#x2F;8K游戏&#x2F;云游戏、智慧银行;<br>URLLC（高可靠低时延）应用场景包括: 工业自动化、移动医疗、自动驾驶;<br>MMTC（海量物流）应用场景包括:智慧城市、智能家居。</p><p>点击开始后会出现特定场景，我们来选择合适的位置</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418165029285.png" alt="image-20260418165029285"></p><p>移动医疗—&gt;URLCC</p><p>VR——–&gt;EMBB</p><p>自动驾驶——&gt;URLLC</p><p>AR————&gt;EMBB</p><p>智慧银行———-&gt;EMBB</p><p>智能家居———–&gt;MMTC</p><p>工业自动化————&gt;URLLC</p><p>4K&#x2F;8K点播—————&gt;EMBB</p><p>4K&#x2F;8K云游戏————&gt;EMBB</p><p>4K&#x2F;8K直播—————&gt;EMBB</p><p>4K&#x2F;8K游戏—————&gt;EMBB</p><p>智慧城市———–&gt;MMTC</p><p>完成后记得保存</p><h4 id="EPC"><a href="#EPC" class="headerlink" title="EPC:"></a>EPC:</h4><p>固定中英互译</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418165845289.png" alt="image-20260418165845289"></p><h4 id="传输1（延安，会宁，遵义）："><a href="#传输1（延安，会宁，遵义）：" class="headerlink" title="传输1（延安，会宁，遵义）："></a>传输1（延安，会宁，遵义）：</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418165949226.png" alt="image-20260418165949226"></p><h4 id="传输2"><a href="#传输2" class="headerlink" title="传输2"></a>传输2</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418170117242.png" alt="image-20260418170117242"></p><h4 id="传输1（湘江，井冈山，瑞金）："><a href="#传输1（湘江，井冈山，瑞金）：" class="headerlink" title="传输1（湘江，井冈山，瑞金）："></a>传输1（湘江，井冈山，瑞金）：</h4><h4 id="ODF："><a href="#ODF：" class="headerlink" title="ODF："></a>ODF：</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418171225744.png" alt="image-20260418171225744"></p><p>根据各地点机房ODF画出他的简单逻辑，只看双向，单向不管</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418171449814.png" alt="image-20260418171449814"></p><p>传输一为SC，光缆成端区为SC所以线缆选择为—–&gt;SC-SC,以此类推</p><h3 id="会宁汇集机房"><a href="#会宁汇集机房" class="headerlink" title="会宁汇集机房"></a>会宁汇集机房</h3><h4 id="传输1"><a href="#传输1" class="headerlink" title="传输1"></a>传输1</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418170213233.png" alt="image-20260418170213233"></p><h3 id="遵义汇聚机房"><a href="#遵义汇聚机房" class="headerlink" title="遵义汇聚机房"></a>遵义汇聚机房</h3><h4 id="传输1-1"><a href="#传输1-1" class="headerlink" title="传输1"></a>传输1</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418170255009.png" alt="image-20260418170255009"></p><h3 id="湘江接入机房"><a href="#湘江接入机房" class="headerlink" title="湘江接入机房"></a>湘江接入机房</h3><h4 id="传输1-2"><a href="#传输1-2" class="headerlink" title="传输1"></a>传输1</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418170403325.png" alt="image-20260418170403325"></p><h4 id="传输2-1"><a href="#传输2-1" class="headerlink" title="传输2"></a>传输2</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418170423049.png" alt="image-20260418170423049"></p><h4 id="ODF"><a href="#ODF" class="headerlink" title="ODF:"></a>ODF:</h4><p>注意湘江 井冈山 瑞金是接入型机房，所以一个传输需要有两个传输类型</p><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418172204096.png" alt="image-20260418172204096"></p><h3 id="井冈山，瑞金同上"><a href="#井冈山，瑞金同上" class="headerlink" title="井冈山，瑞金同上"></a>井冈山，瑞金同上</h3><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418172332919.png" alt="image-20260418172332919"></p><p>配置完成后如图所示</p><h2 id="第十三届信科赛-大唐杯信令流程，照着填"><a href="#第十三届信科赛-大唐杯信令流程，照着填" class="headerlink" title="第十三届信科赛 大唐杯信令流程，照着填"></a>第十三届信科赛 大唐杯信令流程，照着填</h2><h4 id="5G系统信息获取："><a href="#5G系统信息获取：" class="headerlink" title="5G系统信息获取："></a>5G系统信息获取：</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173203585.png" alt="image-20260418173203585"></p><h4 id="随机接入和RRC连接"><a href="#随机接入和RRC连接" class="headerlink" title="随机接入和RRC连接"></a>随机接入和RRC连接</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173726273.png" alt="image-20260418173726273"></p><h4 id="NAS鉴权加密过程"><a href="#NAS鉴权加密过程" class="headerlink" title="NAS鉴权加密过程"></a>NAS鉴权加密过程</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173739882.png" alt="image-20260418173739882"></p><h4 id="UE能力询问与接入层加密"><a href="#UE能力询问与接入层加密" class="headerlink" title="UE能力询问与接入层加密"></a>UE能力询问与接入层加密</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173751828.png" alt="image-20260418173751828"></p><h4 id="5G-RRC重配过程（注册）"><a href="#5G-RRC重配过程（注册）" class="headerlink" title="5G RRC重配过程（注册）"></a>5G RRC重配过程（注册）</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173800962.png" alt="image-20260418173800962"></p><h4 id="PDU-Seesion建立过程"><a href="#PDU-Seesion建立过程" class="headerlink" title="PDU Seesion建立过程"></a>PDU Seesion建立过程</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173812481.png" alt="image-20260418173812481"></p><h4 id="测量切换过程（基站内-Xn-NG）"><a href="#测量切换过程（基站内-Xn-NG）" class="headerlink" title="测量切换过程（基站内&#x2F;Xn&#x2F;NG）"></a>测量切换过程（基站内&#x2F;Xn&#x2F;NG）</h4><p><img src="C:\Users\32638\AppData\Roaming\Typora\typora-user-images\image-20260418173827031.png" alt="image-20260418173827031"></p>]]></content>
      
      
      
